    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.quest.QuestTextData",
    "Message" : {
      "En" : "When working in a mine, one becomes inevitably \r\nnervous at the sound of cave-ins or landslides. \r\nA delayed judgment can cost one's life. \r\nHowever, the sound I heard yesterday... \r\nWhile it was indeed the sound of dirt, \r\nit felt different from a landslide. \r\nI had a bad premonition, \r\nso I quickly withdrew from work.",
      "Jp" : "鉱山で働いていると、落盤やがけ崩れの音には\r\nどうしても神経質になる\r\n判断が遅れれば命にかかわるからな\r\nでも、昨日聞いたあの音――\r\n土の音には違いないが、地崩れとは違う感じだった\r\n悪い予感がしたんで、仕事は早々に引き揚げたよ"
    },
